#: items.lua:34
#: leads.lua:64
msgid "Lead"
msgstr "Rienda"

#: items.lua:42
msgid "Leads can be used for moving and tethering animals. They can also be attached between two fences for decoration."
msgstr ""
"Las correas se pueden usar para mover y atar animales. También se pueden "
"colocar entre dos vallas para decorar."

#: items.lua:43
msgid "Right-click on an animal or fence to attach a lead. Punch the lead to release it, or right-click on a fence to tether it."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic derecho en un animal o cerca para adjuntar una correa. Dale un "
"golpe a la correa para soltarla, o haz clic derecho en una cerca para atarla."

